      "widgets_values": [
        "PACE\n1.0 = tested default. Above 1 is faster; below 1 is slower. This adjusts generation duration, not playback pitch.\n\nSEED\nKeep fixed to repeat a take. Randomise for a different performance.\n\nSAVED AUTOMATICALLY\noutput/zura_voice/Project_Date_ID/\nvoice.wav = 24-bit WAV\nmaster_float32.wav = untouched float master\nchunk_*.wav = individual long-script clips\nreport.json + script.txt = settings and text\n\nLongCat 3.5B | Local CUDA | APG 4 | 16 steps\nEnglish + Chinese. Use authorised voices."
